msgstr "Baza podataka ClientFence je na ažuriranju :level."

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_update.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence does not have sufficient filesystem permissions to perform the update on this server. Please review the issues below and resolve them before attempting the update again."
msgstr "ClientFence nema dovoljne dozvole na sistemu datoteka za ažuriranje na ovom serveru. Molimo pregledajte probleme ispod i riješite ih prije novog pokušaja ažuriranja."

#: src/library/ClientFence/Update.php
msgid "ClientFence does not have sufficient filesystem permissions to perform the update. Resolve the reported issues before trying again."
msgstr "ClientFence nema dovoljne dozvole na sistemu datoteka za ažuriranje. Riješite prijavljene probleme prije novog pokušaja."

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_update.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence downloads the release and checks it, then saves a backup of the database and of every file the release replaces in the server backups folder. It installs the release with maintenance mode on, updates the database and logs you out of the admin area. The site reopens as soon as the update is complete. If the database update needs attention, you will be asked to finalize it after logging back in."
msgstr "ClientFence preuzima izdanje i provjerava ga, zatim čuva sigurnosnu kopiju baze podataka i svake datoteke koju izdanje zamjenjuje u mapi sigurnosnih kopija servera. Instalira izdanje s uključenim načinom održavanja, ažurira bazu podataka i odjavljuje vas iz administratorske zone. Stranica se ponovo otvara čim se ažuriranje završi. Ako ažuriranje baze podataka traži pažnju, nakon ponovne prijave bit ćete zamoljeni da ga završite."

#: src/modules/Extension/templates/admin/mod_extension_index.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence gives developers all the capabilities to customize, integrate, and extend the core system into your own website and applications."
msgstr "ClientFence programerima daje sve mogućnosti za prilagođavanje, integraciju i proširenje osnovnog sistema u vaše vlastite web stranice i aplikacije."

#: src/modules/System/Service.php
msgid "ClientFence has detected that cron hasn't been run in an abnormal time period. Please ensure the cronjob is configured to be run every 5 minutes."
msgstr "ClientFence je otkrio da se cron nije pokrenuo neuobičajeno dugo. Provjerite da je cron zadatak konfiguriran da se pokreće svakih 5 minuta."

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_update_finalize.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence has successfully applied the patches for version %version%."
msgstr "ClientFence je uspješno primijenio zakrpe za verziju %version%."

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_update_finalize.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence is applying update patches. Keep this tab open until the request completes."
msgstr "ClientFence primjenjuje zakrpe ažuriranja. Držite ovu karticu otvorenom dok se zahtjev ne završi."

#: src/modules/Currency/templates/admin/mod_currency_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence is configured to automatically sync currency exchange rates."
msgstr "ClientFence je konfiguriran da automatski sinhronizira kurseve valuta."

#: src/modules/Currency/templates/admin/mod_currency_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence is not configured to automatically sync currency exchange rates."
msgstr "ClientFence nije konfiguriran da automatski sinhronizira kurseve valuta."

#: src/library/ClientFence/Api/Dispatcher.php
msgid "ClientFence module :mod is not installed/activated"
msgstr "ClientFence modul :mod nije instaliran/aktiviran"

#: src/modules/Email/templates/admin/mod_email_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence queues emails to have them be sent via cron in the background. Here you may find the list of queued emails and how many times the system has tried to send them."
msgstr "ClientFence stavlja e-mailove u red čekanja kako bi ih cron slao u pozadini. Ovdje možete naći listu e-mailova u redu čekanja i koliko puta je sistem pokušao da ih pošalje."

#: src/modules/Serviceapikey/templates/admin/mod_serviceapikey_config.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence removes the \"custom_\" prefix when returning these values through the API. For example, \"custom_monthlyLimit\" becomes \"monthlyLimit\"."
msgstr "ClientFence uklanja prefiks \"custom_\" kada vraća ove vrijednosti putem API-ja. Na primjer, \"custom_monthlyLimit\" postaje \"monthlyLimit\"."

#: src/modules/System/Service.php
msgid "ClientFence requires :extension extension to be enabled on this server for security reasons."
msgstr "ClientFence iz sigurnosnih razloga zahtijeva da na ovom serveru bude omogućeno proširenje :extension."

#: src/library/ClientFence/Mail.php
msgid "ClientFence requires the proc_open and escapeshellarg PHP functions to be enabled when using the sendmail transport"
msgstr "ClientFence zahtijeva da PHP funkcije proc_open i escapeshellarg budu omogućene kada se koristi sendmail transport"

#: src/modules/Email/templates/admin/mod_email_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence sends email using Sendmail by default, or you can configure SMTP, SendGrid, or a custom Symfony mailer DSN."
msgstr "ClientFence prema zadanom šalje e-mailove putem Sendmaila, ili možete konfigurirati SMTP, SendGrid ili prilagođeni Symfony mailer DSN."

#: src/modules/Extension/templates/admin/mod_extension_languages.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence ships with its translations. To add another language, place its translation files on the server."
msgstr "ClientFence dolazi sa svojim prijevodima. Da dodate drugi jezik, postavite njegove datoteke prijevoda na server."

#: src/modules/Currency/templates/admin/mod_currency_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence supports several exchange-rate providers. By default it uses the ExchangeRate-API Open Access endpoint, which works without extra configuration."
msgstr "ClientFence podržava više pružalaca kurseva. Prema zadanom koristi ExchangeRate-API Open Access endpoint, koji radi bez dodatne konfiguracije."

#: src/modules/Api/Controller/Client.php
msgid "ClientFence update finalization is pending. Complete finalization before using the admin API."
msgstr "Završetak ažuriranja ClientFence je na čekanju. Završite ga prije korištenja administratorskog API-ja."

