#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig
msgid "Clients and staff see their own last sign-ins on their profile (date, country, network, browser and IP address) and can sign out their other sessions. The login history pages show the same details. They are kept as long as the rest of the activity log."
msgstr "Klijenti i osoblje vide svoje posljednje prijave na profilu (datum, država, mreža, preglednik i IP adresa) i mogu odjaviti svoje druge sesije. Stranice historije prijava prikazuju iste podatke. Čuvaju se onoliko dugo koliko i ostatak zapisnika aktivnosti."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_google.html.twig
msgid "Clients and their authorized users can sign in with their Google account, and new visitors can create an account with it. Two-factor sign-in still asks for its code."
msgstr "Klijenti i njihovi ovlašteni korisnici mogu se prijaviti svojim Google računom, a novi posjetioci mogu njime otvoriti račun. Dvofaktorska prijava i dalje traži svoj kod."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
