#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalAutoPay.php
msgid "Clients can also pay an invoice with PayPal without setting up automatic payments."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu platiti fakturu putem PayPala i bez postavljanja automatskih plaćanja."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Eway.php src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayTabs.php
msgid "Clients can also pay an invoice with a card without setting up automatic payments."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu platiti fakturu karticom i bez postavljanja automatskih plaćanja."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "Clients can also pay an invoice without setting up automatic payments."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu platiti fakturu i bez postavljanja automatskih plaćanja."

#: src/modules/Order/templates/admin/mod_order_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients can move an active service to another product or billing cycle from its page. The price is prorated: the unused part of the current period is credited, an upgrade is invoiced and applied when paid, and a downgrade credit goes to the client's account balance. Each product, and each service, can also allow or block them."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sa stranice aktivne usluge premjestiti uslugu na drugi proizvod ili obračunski period. Cijena je proporcionalna: neiskorišteni dio trenutnog perioda se odobrava, nadogradnja se fakturiše i primjenjuje kada se plati, a kredit od prelaska na niži paket ide na stanje računa klijenta. Svaki proizvod i svaka usluga ih mogu i dozvoliti ili blokirati."

#: src/modules/Servicehosting/templates/admin/mod_servicehosting_config.html.twig
msgid "Clients can restore backups"
msgstr "Klijenti mogu vraćati sigurnosne kopije"

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayTabs.php
msgid "Clients can save a card on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice (PayTabs checks the card without charging it)."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati karticu na stranici Načini plaćanja bez plaćanja fakture (PayTabs provjerava karticu bez naplate)."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Eway.php
msgid "Clients can save a card on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati karticu na stranici Načini plaćanja bez plaćanja fakture."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "Clients can save a card or PayPal account on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice (Mollie checks it without charging it)."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati karticu ili PayPal račun na stranici Načini plaćanja bez plaćanja fakture (Mollie ih provjerava bez naplate)."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "Clients can save a card or bank account at Mollie and their invoices are then charged to it automatically. Turn it off if recurring payments are not enabled for your Mollie account; clients then pay each invoice on Mollie's page."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati karticu ili bankovni račun kod Mollie, a njihove fakture se zatim automatski naplaćuju s njih. Isključite ovo ako ponavljajuća plaćanja nisu omogućena za vaš Mollie račun; klijenti tada svaku fakturu plaćaju na stranici Mollie."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings_cards.html.twig
msgid "Clients can save a card with Stripe, or their PayPal account (PayPal settings: Saved PayPal accounts), when they pay or on their Payment methods page. The method they saved or chose last is charged automatically for unpaid invoices that have no payment method or one of these."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati karticu kod Stripea ili svoj PayPal račun (PayPal postavke: Sačuvani PayPal računi) kada plaćaju ili na stranici Načini plaćanja. Način koji su posljednji sačuvali ili odabrali automatski se naplaćuje za neplaćene fakture koje nemaju način plaćanja ili imaju jedan od ovih."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalEmail.php
msgid "Clients can save their PayPal account when they pay or on their Payment methods page, and their invoices are then paid automatically, as with saved cards. Needs the REST API keys and the Vault (\"Save payment methods\") on your PayPal REST app, which PayPal offers in some countries only."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu sačuvati svoj PayPal račun kada plaćaju ili na stranici Načini plaćanja, a njihove fakture se zatim plaćaju automatski, kao sa sačuvanim karticama. Trebaju REST API ključevi i Vault (\"Save payment methods\") na vašoj PayPal REST aplikaciji, koji PayPal nudi samo u nekim državama."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/GoCardless.php
msgid "Clients can set up a Direct Debit on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu postaviti direktno zaduženje (Direct Debit) na stranici Načini plaćanja bez plaćanja fakture."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalAutoPay.php
msgid "Clients can set up automatic payments on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu postaviti automatska plaćanja na stranici Načini plaćanja bez plaćanja fakture."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients can turn marketing email off on their profile. Every Mass Mailer email gets an unsubscribe link and one-click unsubscribe headers, and Mass Mailer skips clients who opted out. Service email (invoices, tickets, sign-in) always goes."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu isključiti marketinške e-mailove na svom profilu. Svaki e-mail iz Masovnog e-maila dobija link za odjavu i zaglavlja za odjavu jednim klikom, a Masovni e-mail preskače klijente koji su se odjavili. E-mailovi o uslugama (fakture, tiketi, prijava) uvijek se šalju."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings_receipts.html.twig
msgid "Clients can upload a payment receipt on an invoice. Each receipt opens a support ticket, so your team can confirm the payment."
msgstr "Klijenti mogu učitati potvrdu o uplati na fakturi. Svaka potvrda otvara tiket podrške kako bi vaš tim mogao potvrditi uplatu."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Custom.php
msgid "Clients can upload a receipt:"
msgstr "Klijenti mogu učitati potvrdu o uplati:"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_settings_store.html.twig
msgid "Clients can’t see the store or order. Staff can still create orders for them in the admin area."
msgstr "Klijenti ne mogu vidjeti prodavnicu niti naručivati. Osoblje i dalje može praviti narudžbe za njih u administratorskoj zoni."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients choose an amount on the Wallet page and get one email when their balance falls below it."
msgstr "Klijenti biraju iznos na stranici Novčanik i dobijaju jedan e-mail kada im stanje padne ispod njega."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_affiliates.html.twig
msgid "Clients find the program on the Affiliates page of the client area. Staff can make any client an affiliate on the client's Affiliate tab."
msgstr "Klijenti pronalaze program na stranici Partneri u klijentskoj zoni. Osoblje može bilo kojeg klijenta učiniti partnerom na kartici Partner tog klijenta."

#: src/modules/Invoice/ServicePayGateway.php
msgid "Clients have saved payment methods on this gateway. Disable it instead of deleting it."
msgstr "Klijenti imaju sačuvane načine plaćanja na ovom platnom prolazu. Onemogućite ga umjesto brisanja."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig
msgid "Clients in scope, and the authorized users of their accounts, must set up an authenticator app: until they do, every client page after sign-in goes to the two-factor setup. Staff \"Login to Client Area\" is not asked. Staff can still switch the app off for a client who lost a phone: the client sets it up again at the next sign-in."
msgstr "Klijenti u opsegu i ovlašteni korisnici njihovih računa moraju postaviti aplikaciju za autentifikaciju: dok to ne urade, svaka klijentska stranica nakon prijave vodi na postavljanje dvofaktorske provjere. Za \"Prijavi se u klijentsku zonu\" osoblja se ne traži. Osoblje i dalje može isključiti aplikaciju klijentu koji je izgubio telefon: klijent je ponovo postavlja pri sljedećoj prijavi."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_id_documents.html.twig
msgid "Clients in these groups"
msgstr "Klijenti u ovim grupama"

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_affiliates.html.twig
msgid "Clients may join by themselves"
msgstr "Klijenti se mogu sami pridružiti"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_helpdesk_mail.html.twig
msgid "Clients only"
msgstr "Samo klijenti"

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients rate each staff reply from 1 to 5 stars on the ticket page; Support > Ratings & Feedback shows the results. The feedback email when a ticket closes is set on each help desk."
msgstr "Klijenti ocjenjuju svaki odgovor osoblja od 1 do 5 zvjezdica na stranici tiketa; Podrška > Ocjene i povratne informacije prikazuje rezultate. E-mail za povratne informacije pri zatvaranju tiketa postavlja se za svaku službu podrške."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_ratings.html.twig
msgid "Clients rate each staff reply from 1 to 5 stars, and score each staff member from 1 to 10 in the feedback form emailed when a ticket closes. Reply ratings are switched on in Support settings; the feedback email on each help desk."
msgstr "Klijenti ocjenjuju svaki odgovor osoblja od 1 do 5 zvjezdica i ocjenjuju svakog člana osoblja od 1 do 10 u obrascu za povratne informacije koji se šalje e-mailom pri zatvaranju tiketa. Ocjene odgovora uključuju se u postavkama Podrške; e-mail za povratne informacije za svaku službu podrške."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_network_issue.html.twig
msgid "Clients see it on the Network Status page; those it affects also see a banner while it is open or scheduled."
msgstr "Klijenti to vide na stranici Status mreže; oni na koje utiče vide i traku dok je otvoren ili zakazan."

#: src/modules/Product/templates/admin/mod_product_option.html.twig
msgid "Clients see it on the order form, the service page and invoices."
msgstr "Klijenti to vide na obrascu narudžbe, stranici usluge i fakturama."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_gateways.html.twig
msgid "Clients see the payment methods in this order; the first one they can use is picked by default."
msgstr "Klijenti vide načine plaćanja ovim redoslijedom; prvi koji mogu koristiti bira se prema zadanom."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_setup.html.twig
msgid "Clients see your instructions and you mark the invoice paid."
msgstr "Klijenti vide vaša uputstva, a vi označavate fakturu kao plaćenu."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_id_documents.html.twig
msgid "Clients who are asked upload the front and back of an ID document (JPG, PNG, WebP or PDF) on their ID document page. Staff approve or refuse it on the client's ID documents tab, and the client gets an email either way. Orders of a client asked by the first two rules wait for review until the document is approved; approving it lets them go on. The files are encrypted and only staff can download them."
msgstr "Klijenti od kojih se traži učitavaju prednju i zadnju stranu ličnog dokumenta (JPG, PNG, WebP ili PDF) na svojoj stranici ličnog dokumenta. Osoblje ga odobrava ili odbija na kartici Lični dokumenti klijenta, a klijent u oba slučaja dobija e-mail. Narudžbe klijenta od kojeg to traže prva dva pravila čekaju pregled dok se dokument ne odobri; odobrenje ih pušta dalje. Datoteke su šifrirane i samo ih osoblje može preuzeti."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_settings_store.html.twig
msgid "Clients who can order"
msgstr "Klijenti koji mogu naručivati"

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_gateway.html.twig
msgid "Clients who pay with this gateway pay this fee: a line added to the invoice, changed when they pick another gateway. Credit pays no fee. Check that your card scheme and local law allow surcharges."
msgstr "Klijenti koji plaćaju ovim platnim prolazom plaćaju ovu naknadu: stavku dodanu na fakturu, koja se mijenja kada odaberu drugi platni prolaz. Kredit ne plaća naknadu. Provjerite da vaša kartična shema i lokalni zakon dozvoljavaju doplate."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Run.php
msgid "Clients whose credit matches"
msgstr "Klijenti čiji kredit odgovara"

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_network_issue.html.twig
msgid "Clients with a hosting service on this server are affected."
msgstr "Pogođeni su klijenti s hosting uslugom na ovom serveru."

#: src/modules/Custompages/templates/admin/mod_custompages_index.html.twig src/modules/Custompages/templates/admin/mod_custompages_page.html.twig
msgid "Clients with an active service"
msgstr "Klijenti s aktivnom uslugom"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Clients with the most credit"
msgstr "Klijenti s najviše kredita"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Clients' billing agreements of WHMCS's PayPal Billing Agreements gateway (PayPal Auto-Pay) become their saved PayPal Auto-Pay method, so renewals are charged without them agreeing again. Install PayPal Auto-Pay with the same PayPal API details first, and stop WHMCS from charging them."
msgstr "Ugovori o naplati klijenata iz WHMCS platnog prolaza PayPal Billing Agreements (PayPal Auto-Pay) postaju njihov sačuvani PayPal Auto-Pay način, pa se obnove naplaćuju bez ponovnog pristanka. Prvo instalirajte PayPal Auto-Pay s istim PayPal API podacima i zaustavite naplatu iz WHMCS-a."

#: src/themes/admin_default/html_custom/partial_admin_auth_card.html.twig
msgid "Clients, orders, invoices and support in one place."
msgstr "Klijenti, narudžbe, fakture i podrška na jednom mjestu."

